WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
Do you love your ex?

2
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.700
Yes. You do? Yes.

3
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.000
Come on, call him and ask him to make up.

4
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.100
Okay. Do you want to? I do.

5
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.300
How long ago did you break up?

6
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:09.200
Two weeks ago.

7
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:12.200
Gagi puts relationships together, mostly he breaks them up.

8
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.100
Hello. Hello.

9
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.000
Let's make up, I have been thinking about it for a long time.

10
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:20.300
Didn't you say that we don't talk anymore?

11
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.800
Yes, but I thought a bit and I think I made a mistake.

12
00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:29.400
Seriously? Yes.

13
00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:31.800
Okay, come on, I love you, bye.

14
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:32.900
Come on, bye.

15
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Come on, let's go!

16
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.000
Well, I have to put some couple together, I can't only break them up.

17
00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.500
Like this clip and follow me.
